# The Steps 9-10 ruling: a value left in a tool's field blocks the keys only
# until the field first has the keyboard. The Point tool adds P1; the
# Circle tool, centred on it, gets "3" typed for its radius; a click on an
# Elements row takes the keyboard, the 3 waiting in the field; Ctrl+Z then
# undoes P1, which drops the circle under way.
open docs/instances/sketch-basic.json
wait 16
action tool.point
wait 2
click L 724 291
wait 2
key Escape
wait 2
action tool.circle
wait 2
click L 724 291
move 772 275 3
text "3"
wait 3
click L 1150 200
wait 3
key Z ctrl
wait 3
